==English==

===Prepositional phrase===
{{en-PP|head=[[through]] the [[roof]]}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic|figurative}} At a very high level.
#: {{ux|en|Fuel prices have gone '''through the roof''' since last fall.}}
#: {{ux|en|Fuel prices are '''through the roof''' this winter.}}
